Private live-view source attribution

The viewport and logger-buffer operations adapt ConfCtl::Cli::LogView,
ConfCtl::Logger and ConfCtl::LineBuffer at
ac2afe17ebc9722e3d6a02540465b5eb367ed6a1. Confctl remains GPL-3.0-only;
see the project LICENSE.txt. Native bindings and progress bars are not included.

The SGR uncolor pattern adapts Rainbow 3.1.1
(lib/rainbow/string_utils.rb); the Linux cursor byte operations adapt
tty-cursor 0.7.1 (lib/tty/cursor.rb). Their complete MIT notices follow.

